              "p": "Let $\\mathcal{L}$ be a scalar loss and write $\\delta^{(\\ell)} = \\partial \\mathcal{L} / \\partial z^{(\\ell)}$. Derive the backpropagation recursions for $\\delta^{(\\ell)}$, $\\partial \\mathcal{L}/\\partial W^{(\\ell)}$, and $\\partial \\mathcal{L}/\\partial b^{(\\ell)}$.",
