              "p": "Matrix multiplication is associative, so $W_3W_2W_1x = (W_3W_2W_1)x = Wx$ for the single matrix $W = W_3W_2W_1$. The composition of linear maps is linear, regardless of the shapes involved, so D is wrong too.",
