          "p": "has its minima at $(0, 1)$ and $(0, -1)$, with $f = 0$, and a stationary point at $(0, 0)$, with $f = \\tfrac12$. Gradient descent runs with $\\eta = 0.1$ from $(1, 10^{-6})$.",
