              "p": "That is 376,832 weights and 2,560 for batch normalization, 379,392 in all, about 5 times the 75,008 of stage 1's first block. The 3 × 3 convolution alone grows 4 times, from 36,864 to 147,456, because both of its channel numbers doubled.",
